bjects in your space with text and audio labels, making learning immersive and contextually relevant. Dive into our Word Shuffle mini-game to reinforce your skills and beat the timer. \n\nCurrent Features:\nTagging Language: English\nLearning Language: French\nMini-Game: Word Shuffle\n470+ available tags geared towards common living room objects such as \u201cCouch\u201d, \u201cTelevision\u201d, and \u201cGaming Console\u201d\n\nFluentXR is an ever-evolving platform, continually expanding its selection of languages and mini-games. Achieve language mastery with FluentXR\u2014where your home becomes your classroom.", "short_description": "Transform your language learning experience.\n\nUtilizing mixed-reality passthrough technology turn your home into a dynamic classroom. Tag real-world objects in your living room with 470+ customizable tags for learning French. Sharpen your skills through the Word Shuffle mini-game.\n\nFluentXR is an ever-evolving platform, updating with new languages and interactive mini-games. Dive into a context-rich home environment that's both captivating and practical."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Fluent XR Cover Art - Portrait.png", "id": "6647755272010080", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982588_6647755275343413_6975862371154701560_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IB0-Bh3_eq0Q7kNvwH7bXVG&_nc_oc=Adl86z3iLLCHqU5GuOJAhrU_WQbRmkhTY6554mnaeJFaCk8EGOyks4sijPtjsIv7ByQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs9lGY9-113X9zPo500HRGv8DYfn6P1OxD0gIrNizJSCA&oe=699EF7B4"}, {"file_name": "Fluent XR Mobile Icon.png", "id": "2082304598777986", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974858_2082304602111319_6670855186104070571_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lp71t6vwiEoQ7kNvwFAXyXM&_nc_oc=Admvh2-AsyFt4OJP95Xc5qvNVaQOwPypa3DnS_ZHOO2i5lAcA4Zah8E8eLDsdIT_VvI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams